<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>As the days go on and on</l><l>There’s a hold that is so strong.</l><l>A tide floods all my being—</l><l>For I’m in love.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>There’s a face I long to see</l><l>Whose arms will embrace me.</l><l>As I rest in this sweet place</l><l>I love Him more and more.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
